@startuml
title Combined Failure Sequence (Revocation + Storage + Thermal)
participant "IdP" as IDP
participant "Cross-domain Orchestrator" as ORCH
participant "Storage Controller" as STOR
participant "GPU Thermal Controller" as GPU
participant "Auth Service" as AUTH
participant "Incident Commander" as IC

IDP -> ORCH: Critical revocation event
STOR -> ORCH: Tier-0 latency and path failure
GPU -> ORCH: Thermal hotspot > threshold
ORCH -> AUTH: Enter safe mode
AUTH -> AUTH: Freeze non-critical writes
ORCH -> STOR: Promote standby + fence stale writer
ORCH -> GPU: Shed inferencing and cap clocks
AUTH -> IC: Report state + residual risk
ORCH -> IC: Correlated timeline and remediation status
@enduml
